{"seq":2,"slug":"proactive-notification-orchestration","title":"主动通知编排与触发时机策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/post-purchase-engagement-experience-hub/tracking-proactive-communication/proactive-notification-orchestration","wordCount":3124,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"主动通知编排与触发时机策略\">主动通知编排与触发时机策略</h1><p>一条 <code>OutForDelivery</code> 事件的价值不是恒定的：它在包裹即将到达的那两小时里能显著降低用户主动查询与客服工单，但若延迟六小时才推达，用户往往已经签收——这条通知就从「服务」变成了「骚扰」。<strong>主动通知编排要解决的，是把上游归一后的状态事件，在正确的时间窗、通过正确的渠道、以正确的频次投递给正确的人，并在用户不愿接收时安静退出。</strong> 它是一套带状态、带预算、可审计的决策系统，而不是在事件回调里直接调一次推送 SDK。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-主动通知是-事件-决策-投递-的三段式\">核心概念：主动通知是「事件 → 决策 → 投递」的三段式</h2><p>把编排写成回调函数是这一层最常见的架构缺陷。回调只回答「发生了什么」，而同一个物理事件其实要回答四个独立问题：<strong>该不该通知</strong>（价值判断）、<strong>什么时候通知</strong>（时机）、<strong>走哪条路通知</strong>（渠道）、<strong>通知过没有</strong>（去重与频控）。四者各有独立的失败模式与配置面，混在一段函数里会随承运商与渠道数量增长而不可维护。规范做法是拆成三段，中间用**通知意图（notification intent）**这一显式数据结构解耦：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[&quot;归一状态事件&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;价值判定&lt;br/&gt;should-notify&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; C[&quot;时机求解&lt;br/&gt;时区/免打扰/时效窗&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; D[&quot;渠道求解&lt;br/&gt;channel ladder&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; E[&quot;频控与去重&lt;br/&gt;cap / dedup key&quot;]&#10;  E --&gt; F{&quot;用户同意状态&quot;}&#10;  F --&gt;|&quot;已同意&quot;| G[&quot;投递适配器&lt;br/&gt;APNs / FCM / Email / SMS&quot;]&#10;  F --&gt;|&quot;未同意或退订&quot;| H[&quot;降级站内消息&lt;br/&gt;或静默归档&quot;]&#10;  G --&gt; I[&quot;送达回执与归因&quot;]&#10;  H --&gt; I&#10;  I --&gt; J[&quot;反馈入流:更新偏好与频次&quot;]\">graph TD\n  A[\"归一状态事件\"] --&gt; B[\"价值判定&lt;br/&gt;should-notify\"]\n  B --&gt; C[\"时机求解&lt;br/&gt;时区/免打扰/时效窗\"]\n  C --&gt; D[\"渠道求解&lt;br/&gt;channel ladder\"]\n  D --&gt; E[\"频控与去重&lt;br/&gt;cap / dedup key\"]\n  E --&gt; F{\"用户同意状态\"}\n  F --&gt;|\"已同意\"| G[\"投递适配器&lt;br/&gt;APNs / FCM / Email / SMS\"]\n  F --&gt;|\"未同意或退订\"| H[\"降级站内消息&lt;br/&gt;或静默归档\"]\n  G --&gt; I[\"送达回执与归因\"]\n  H --&gt; I\n  I --&gt; J[\"反馈入流:更新偏好与频次\"]</pre><p>好处是<strong>可测试</strong>：价值判定与时机求解都是纯函数，只有投递段有副作用，使「为什么这条通知在凌晨三点发出去了」变成可单测复现的问题，而非日志考古。另一个必须先确立的判断是主动推送不能替代订单详情页时间轴：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>被动查询（时间轴）</th>\n<th>主动通知（编排）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>触发者</td>\n<td>用户</td>\n<td>系统</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时效要求</td>\n<td>弱（容忍分钟级延迟）</td>\n<td>强（按状态分桶的 P95 预算）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>信息量</td>\n<td>全量检查点</td>\n<td>单个里程碑 + 一个动作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>失败代价</td>\n<td>多刷新一次</td>\n<td>打扰、退订、卸载</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>核心指标</td>\n<td>查询成功率</td>\n<td>送达率、打开率、退订率、工单下降</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>主动通知的失败代价是不对称的</strong>——少发一条损失有限，错发一条会侵蚀通知权限本身。因此默认策略应当是「宁可沉默，不可打扰」，把发送当作需要主动争取预算的动作。</p>\n<h2 id=\"触发时机模型-时效窗口与边际收益递减\">触发时机模型：时效窗口与边际收益递减</h2><p>通知的价值随时间衰减，衰减速率高度依赖状态类型。为每个状态定义<strong>价值半衰期</strong>是把时机问题量化的最小模型 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V(t) = V_0 \\cdot 2^{-t / t_{1/2}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8914em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8914em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.0664em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3448em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5357em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1/2</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3695em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是事件发生瞬间的边际价值。<code>OutForDelivery</code> 的半衰期以小时计，<code>Delivered</code> 触发评价激励的半衰期可放宽到一两天——签收后用户对「求评价」的容忍度下降得慢得多。由此得出一条规则：<strong>投递延迟超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3\\,t\\_{1/2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1/2</span></span></span></span></span></span> 的通知应直接丢弃而非补发</strong>，否则只会造成「货已到、通知才来」的困惑。不同状态的时机预算与渠道差异明显：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>归一状态</th>\n<th>时效预算</th>\n<th>建议渠道</th>\n<th>插入动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>FailedAttempt</code></td>\n<td>十分钟级</td>\n<td>Push + 站内</td>\n<td>再投时间协商入口</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>OutForDelivery</code></td>\n<td>分钟级</td>\n<td>Push（高优先级）</td>\n<td>当日到达预告、配送员联系</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>AvailableForPickup</code></td>\n<td>分钟级</td>\n<td>Push + 短信兜底</td>\n<td>取件码、超期提醒</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Exception</code>（清关/退回）</td>\n<td>分钟级</td>\n<td>Push + 客服主动联系</td>\n<td>安抚话术、补偿入口</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Delivered</code></td>\n<td>小时级</td>\n<td>Push</td>\n<td>评价激励、安装引导</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>InTransit</code></td>\n<td>天级</td>\n<td>仅在长时间无更新时</td>\n<td>停滞安抚</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>时机求解还必须叠加<strong>用户可接收时间</strong>约束：<strong>免打扰窗口（quiet hours）<strong>按用户在设备上配置的时段与当地时区计算，凌晨推送除非标记时效敏感否则延迟到窗口结束；<strong>跨时区对齐</strong>按收件人当地时间而非仓库或运营团队时区——跨境场景下这点常被忽略，导致欧美用户的推送落在深夜；<strong>批量合并窗口</strong>把同一订单短时间内的多个检查点合并成一条。时间表示本身也有标准：时间戳应统一用带偏移的 ISO 8601 / RFC 3339 形式（如 <code>2026-10-07T14:32:00+08:00</code>）存储，并</strong>同时保存用户时区标识</strong>（IANA tz database，如 <code>Europe/Berlin</code>）而非仅存偏移量——偏移量随夏令时切换而变，用它做跨季节的「次日九点提醒」会错一小时。</p>\n<h2 id=\"编排引擎-优先级-去重与频次预算\">编排引擎：优先级、去重与频次预算</h2><p>编排引擎的核心状态是<strong>每个用户的发送预算</strong>——一个滑动窗口计数器，而非日计数器。控制维度有三：<strong>全局频次上限（frequency cap）</strong>，每用户每 24 小时的营销类通知上限（交易类通常不占用该预算，产品上须明确区分，避免用户认为「物流通知也是营销」而整体关闭）；<strong>同类事件冷却（cooldown）</strong>，同一订单同一状态类型在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 内只发一次，吸收乱序与重复事件；<strong>去重键（dedup key）</strong>，由 <code>订单号 + 规范状态 + 通知类型</code> 构造并写入幂等存储——投递系统普遍是「至少一次」语义，没有去重键就会在重试时重复打扰。轨迹聚合层去重「同一事件多源到达」，编排层去重「同一语义事件再次触发动作」，两者互补。</p>\n<p>当多条意图竞争有限预算时，优先级为：异常与派送失败类最高（用户有未完成的动作），派送预告次之，营销触达最低；排序应写成配置而非硬编码。合并窗口的判定可形式化为短时聚合：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">⌈</mo><mfrac><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mn mathvariant=\"double-struck\">1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>W</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><mrow><munder><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">⌉</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{merged} = \\left\\lceil \\frac{\\sum_{i} w_i \\cdot \\mathbb{1}[t_i \\in (t_0, t_0 + W)]}{\\max_i w_i} \\right\\rceil</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌈</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4397em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6897em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mclose\">)]</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌉</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是意图权重，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 是合并窗口长度；窗口内总权重不超过单条最高权重时合并为一条，否则按权重拆分——「五个低优先级事件」由此不会演变成五条通知。</p>\n<h2 id=\"渠道与降级链路\">渠道与降级链路</h2><p>渠道选择是成本、到达率、打扰度的三方权衡。跨境场景下渠道矩阵比国内更宽，因为不同市场的主流通信工具差异巨大。App Push（APNs / FCM）送达依赖权限授予但转化最高、单条近乎零成本，是有 App 市场的交易类首选；站内消息中心零成本、打扰度低，适合兜底与合规留痕；邮件受垃圾箱影响波动大但成本极低，适合无 App 用户的派送预告与收据；短信送达率高但各国监管严格、每条计费且跨境更贵，只应用于派送失败与取件码等强时效场景；WhatsApp 一类 IM 在新兴市场是主力触达，但按会话与模板计费。</p>\n<p>核心机制是<strong>降级梯（ladder）</strong>：主渠道投递失败或用户未授予该渠道权限时，按预设顺序降级。降级不能无脑递归——短信降级只在强时效场景启用，否则一次派送预告会变成一条付费短信。降级还必须尊重渠道级同意状态：邮件有独立退订列表，SMS 在许多辖区需要单独的事前同意，IM 渠道通常有平台强制的会话窗口（例如 Meta 系产品区分营销、工具、认证三类模板，客服会话窗口外只能用模板发起）。</p>\n<p>移动端权限本身是编排的前提。iOS 的通知权限自 15 起支持「时效敏感」与「关键」两级中断级别（interruption levels），Android 自 13（API 33）起把通知权限改为运行时申请、自 14 起引入通知冷却机制抑制连续通知，因此<strong>编排器必须知道当前渠道的真实可用状态</strong>，不能假设「装了 App 就能推」——把权限状态作为用户画像的一部分持久化。Web 端推送另有独立标准：协议见 RFC 8030、消息加密见 RFC 8291、应用服务器标识见 RFC 8292（VAPID），适合作为无 App 市场的轻量补充。</p>\n<h2 id=\"合规-用户控制与效果度量\">合规、用户控制与效果度量</h2><p>主动通知处于营销与服务的交界，合规边界必须写进设计。<strong>GDPR 第 21 条</strong>赋予数据主体反对为直接营销目的处理其个人数据的权利，且该反对一经提出即须停止；欧盟《电子隐私指令》（2002/58/EC，各国以 PECR 类法规落地）对非既有客户关系的电子营销通信要求事前同意。<strong>美国 CAN-SPAM 法案</strong>要求商业邮件提供清晰退订机制，<strong>TCPA</strong> 对自动拨号与短信施加更严格的同意要求。中国的《个人信息保护法》（2021-11-01 施行）第 24 条针对自动化决策推送赋予个人拒绝权，配套《互联网信息服务算法推荐管理规定》（2022-03-01 施行）进一步要求提供便捷的关闭选项。跨境运营的实际含义是：<strong>同一个通知决策在 A 市场合法、在 B 市场可能违规</strong>，因此同意状态与退订入口必须按司法辖区建模，而非全局开关。三点在跨境场景里反复出问题：<strong>退订必须是真退订</strong>（营销类触达一旦被退订，编排器须立即从决策层剔除，不能只在前端隐藏入口）；<strong>数据出境</strong>（把收件人标识交给海外聚合商或云推送服务构成一次数据出境，需在合同与数据处理协议层面评估）；<strong>留存与删除</strong>（通知日志含个人数据，应设保留期，运单终态后按策略清理）。</p>\n<p>效果度量要把「用户是否被打扰」和「用户是否被服务」分开看。可用指标包括权限授予率（应稳定或上升）、退订率与关闭率（任何上升都需归因到具体状态模板）、主动查询下降（直接反映通知是否替代了查询）、客服工单变化（派送失败与清关滞留类应显著下降）、发送成本/单（与时效指标同看以防优化时效放大账单）。其中<strong>打开率在隐私保护强化后越来越不可靠</strong>——部分邮件客户端会预取内容、部分平台不再回传阅读状态——因此只能作为相对趋势；更稳健的北极星是「主动查询下降 + 客诉工单下降」的组合，它直接对应通知的产品目的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>主动通知编排的价值，在于把「事件回调里随手推一条」升级为带预算、带时机、带合规边界的决策系统。核心要点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>三段式解耦</strong>：价值判定与时机求解做成纯函数，只有投递段有副作用，中间用显式通知意图传递；这样才能单测复现「为什么凌晨发了通知」。</li>\n<li><strong>价值半衰期模型</strong>：用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V(t) = V_0 \\cdot 2^{-t/t_{1/2}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8914em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8914em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.0664em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3448em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5357em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1/2</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3695em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为每个规范状态定时机预算，超过约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3\\,t_{1/2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9996em;vertical-align:-0.3552em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5198em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1/2</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3552em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的延迟应丢弃而非补发。</li>\n<li><strong>时区是硬约束</strong>：时间戳用带偏移的 ISO 8601 / RFC 3339，同时保存 IANA 用户时区标识；免打扰窗口按收件人当地时间计算。</li>\n<li><strong>频控与去重分两层</strong>：聚合层去重「多源重复事件」，编排层去重「同一语义事件重复触发动作」，去重键写入幂等存储。</li>\n<li><strong>渠道降级有成本</strong>：降级梯按场景分级启用，短信只在强时效与失败场景兜底；渠道同意与权限状态须持久化到用户画像。</li>\n<li><strong>合规按辖区建模</strong>：GDPR 第 21 条、电子隐私指令、CAN-SPAM、TCPA 与中国《个人信息保护法》对同意、退订、关闭的要求各异，退订须落到决策层。</li>\n<li><strong>度量选北极星</strong>：打开率受隐私机制污染，用「主动查询下降 + 客诉工单下降」判断通知是否真在做服务。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>编排层的输入质量决定它的上限——若上游无法可靠区分 <code>Delivered</code> 与 <code>FailedAttempt</code>，再精细的时机模型也会在错误前提上运行。本层的直接上游见同章的 <a href=\"multicarrier-tracking-aggregation\">多承运商物流轨迹聚合与状态归一</a>；订单生命周期与触点模型见 <a href=\"../postpurchase-journey-model/postpurchase-journey-stage-touchpoint\">购后旅程阶段与触点模型</a>，事件的状态机流转见 <a href=\"../postpurchase-journey-model/postpurchase-event-bus-state-machine\">购后事件总线与状态机</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"主动通知编排与触发时机策略","id":"主动通知编排与触发时机策略"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：主动通知是「事件 → 决策 → 投递」的三段式","id":"核心概念-主动通知是-事件-决策-投递-的三段式"},{"level":2,"text":"触发时机模型：时效窗口与边际收益递减","id":"触发时机模型-时效窗口与边际收益递减"},{"level":2,"text":"编排引擎：优先级、去重与频次预算","id":"编排引擎-优先级-去重与频次预算"},{"level":2,"text":"渠道与降级链路","id":"渠道与降级链路"},{"level":2,"text":"合规、用户控制与效果度量","id":"合规-用户控制与效果度量"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"多承运商物流轨迹聚合与状态归一","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/post-purchase-engagement-experience-hub/tracking-proactive-communication/multicarrier-tracking-aggregation"},"next":{"title":"送达预测与延误丢件异常主动干预","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/post-purchase-engagement-experience-hub/tracking-proactive-communication/delivery-eta-exception-intervention"}}